## Scope (Engine-Specific)
GEON performs deterministic Earth-frame computations on sealed inputs:
- explicit frame transforms (LOCAL_CARTESIAN | EARTH_ECEF | EARTH_ENU)
- finite difference V1 gradients/divergence/laplacian on ordered grids
- flux integrals across declared surfaces
- derived indices computed strictly from provided fields (non-forecast)

## Prohibitions (Engine-Specific)
GEON MUST NOT:
- fetch live Earth data or external feeds
- emit forecasts, warnings, or alerts
- infer identity, intent, attribution, or causation
- emit classification, conclusions, or directives (vertical lens only)
- accept peer delivery
